rsey mockup — partner logo on pro CS2 kit"}, "type": "showcase", "brand": "", "title": "Marketing partnership", "caseId": "", "layout": {}}, {"img": "mt-island", "data": {"body": ["Short-form video series and team vlogs filmed on the island — an area where HEROIC leads: bootcamp life, behind-the-scenes, player personalities", "Content built to travel outside the esports bubble, into travel and lifestyle feeds"], "title": "Malta sells itself once people actually see it.", "eyebrow": "Content", "imgHint": "Content still — bootcamp life on the island"}, "type": "showcase", "brand": "", "title": "Content & destination", "caseId": "", "layout": {}}, {"img": "mt-industry", "data": {"body": ["Delivered by an organization the industry already trusts"], "title": "Malta's pitch to the industry", "eyebrow": "B2B & industry positioning", "imgHint": "Industry event — stage or booth, wide"}, "type": "showcase", "brand": "", "title": "B2B positioning", "caseId": "", "layout": {}}, {"img": "", "data": {"text": "Long-term relevance is built at home, not just on broadcast.", "eyebrow": "Grassroots: overview", "attribution": "A sponsorship that only shows up on a jersey has a shelf life. One that builds the next generation of Maltese talent has a legacy."}, "type": "statement", "brand": "", "title": "Grassroots", "caseId": "", "layout": {}}, {"img": "mt-facility", "data": {"title": "On the island", "caption": "Local play, local talent, local venues.", "eyebrow": "Grassroots", "imgHint": "Split image — grassroots play and island location"}, "type": "fullbleed", "brand": "", "title": "Grassroots imagery", "caseId": "", "layout": {}}, {"img": "", "data": {"ask": "Application of Malta's Highly Qualified Persons (HQP) tax scheme to relocating staff — an existing incentive, no new legislation required.", "tag": "The world's first Tier 1 esports team, based in Malta", "title": "Malta as home base", "kicker": "Corporate restructure:", "points": ["HEROIC becomes the first Tier 1 esports organization headquartered in Malta", "Relocation of select staff to the island", "A HEROIC corporate entity established and tax-resident in Malta"], "askEmph": "In exchange, Malta gets a live case study: a global esports brand that chose to build here, not just advertise here.", "imgHint": "Photo — team facility, wide", "askLabel": "The ask:"}, "type": "homebase", "brand": "", "title": "Malta as home base", "caseId": "", "layout": {}}, {"img": "", "data": {"sub": "What GamingMalta gets. What it costs.", "note": "Potentially to be discussed further", "rows": [{"items": ["Jersey integration", "Partnership launch (announcement video, PR push)", "Branding integration into all HEROIC and HEROIC player social media channels"], "label": "Marketing"}, {"items": ["x8 short form videos as part of an overall series highlighting Malta as both a go to travel destination and the esports hub of Europe", "x2 team long form videos integrating Malta (the team sees the sites, enjoys the country, trivia about the island etc)"], "label": "Content"}, {"items": ["CEO / Senior staff presence at industry conferences presenting the HEROIC story of coming to Malta, as well as highlighting our experience with Malta as a hub and destination both for business and esports. We will commit to a minimum of 4 events per year."], "label": "B2B"}, {"items": ["Up to x2 school / university visits per year, with HEROIC staff talking about opportunities for careers in esports", "Establishment of HEROIC x Malta esports academy."], "label": "Grassroots"}], "unit": "usd per year", "title": "Partnership deliverables & investment", "amount": "$1M", "eyebrow": "Partnership", "amountLabel": "Annual investment"}, "type": "invest", "brand": "", "title": "Deliverables & investment", "caseId": "", "layout": {}}, {"img": "", "data": {"cards": [{"tag": "Pricing scoped separately", "head": "Bootcamp investment", "text": "HEROIC as an investor in establishing and marketing a dedicated Malta bootcamp facility, acting as lead a